  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Tai Qiu, a bull shaped desolate beast blocks Fang Yuan’s group. Zhuo Zhan shouts that they dare rob him and charges. Fang Yuan’s strength path giant hand punches at him. He stares, shouts in shock, and escapes in panic.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_myriad_self_giant_hand"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The fist keeps coming; he breaks into cold sweat, retreats to make distance, and after the hand vanishes he has still fallen back a great distance, his gaze toward Fang Yuan carrying immense fear.",
      "chapters": [
        783
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a burly build. He wears a red bronze suit of armor, carries a huge hammer, and rides a fat boar.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He rides a flying boar desolate beast with his body covered in armor, holding a giant hammer.",
      "chapters": [
        789
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land he is burly and armored, holding a pair of bronze hammers while a boar under him tramples a desolate beast iron crown eagle.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a blood veil covers the ruin bat corpse, he shouts that whatever Gu formation it is, it will break with one smash from his hammer, and charges. He is burly and easily irritable, and he bullies the weak while fearing the strong. Several breaths later, as he nears the veil, blood in his body goes out of control; still a far distance away, half the blood in his body has sprayed out.",
      "chapters": [
        789
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-veil",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Dong Fang Yu Liang appears as a new immortal, this demonic path Gu Immortal flies out and leads a charge, trying to pick up a bargain. He shouts that myriad star fireflies cannot be activated so easily. Star thoughts then make his attack change direction toward an ally; his face turns purplish-red and he says his attack changed directions all of a sudden.",
      "chapters": [
        793
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attack-turns-on-an-ally",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Dong Fang Chang Fan flees Jade Pool blessed land, Zhuo Zhan is among those left in the dust, with no third wave of the chase at all.",
      "chapters": [
        804
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among rank six Gu Immortals active around Hei tribe, he stands with Divine Lord Tian Du, Shi Hou, and other experts.",
      "chapters": [
        1101
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribe-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "char_divine_lord_tian_du",
        "char_shi_hou"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Large numbers of Gu Immortals then join the raid; demonic path Gu Immortals such as the Traveling Three Elites, Old Lu, Half Moon Brutemaster, and Zhuo Zhan compete over Hei tribe resources.",
      "chapters": [
        1104
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribe-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_traveling_three_elites",
        "char_half_moon_brutemaster"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land he rides a boar that tramples a desolate beast iron crown eagle, burly, armored, holding a pair of bronze hammers. He Ruo asks to trade that desolate beast for a shadowless horse; he quickly agrees.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribe-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "char_he_ruo"
      ]
    }
  ],
